{
  "id": "chapter-02",
  "kind": "chapter",
  "sourceKind": "chapter",
  "label": "CHAPTER 2-",
  "title": "THE STORIES WE BUILD",
  "shortTitle": "THE STORIES WE BUILD",
  "sourceRange": [
    994,
    1187
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "number": 994,
    "title": 995
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is a strange thing about human"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 996
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "memory."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 997
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It does not store life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 998
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It stores meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 999
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not what happened…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1000
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but what it felt like it meant."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1001
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur dheere dheere, bina realize kiye, hum apni life jeena band kar dete hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1002
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We don’t live experiences anymore."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1003
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We start editing them."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1004
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not once."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1005
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not twice."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1006
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But every single time we remember them."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1007
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek moment hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1008
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A silence after an argument."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1009
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A message that never comes back."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1010
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A reply that feels different from before."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1011
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A door that stays closed a little longer than expected."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1012
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A person jo suddenly unfamiliar lagne lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1013
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Outwardly, nothing dramatic happens."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1014
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But inwardly, something shifts."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1015
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And the mind, almost instantly, fills that silence."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1016
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not with facts…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1017
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but with meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1018
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“They don’t care anymore.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1019
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I was never important.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1020
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“Something is wrong with me.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1021
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“This always happens with me.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1022
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur yeh jo meaning hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1023
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "yeh dheere dheere ek event ko rewrite kar deta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1024
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not in reality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1025
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But in perception."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1026
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum sochte hain hum apni life ko yaad kar rahe hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1027
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But most of the time, we are not remembering life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1028
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We are reconstructing it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1029
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Memory ek static file nahi hoti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1030
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is a living system."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1031
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Har baar jab hum kisi purani memory ko revisit karte hain…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1032
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "we don’t retrieve it like a recording."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1033
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We rebuild it like a story."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1034
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur har reconstruction mein thoda sa change hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1035
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Kuch parts highlight ho jaate hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1036
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Kuch fade ho jaate hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1037
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur kuch completely naye meanings ke saath rewrite ho jaate hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1038
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because we are lying."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1039
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But because raw reality ko carry karna uncomfortable hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1040
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum closure dhoondhte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1041
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even when none exists."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1042
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "First illusion:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1043
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We believe we are recalling life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1044
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But actually, we are rewriting it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1045
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek rejection hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1046
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Technically simple."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1047
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A “no”."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1048
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Bas itna."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1049
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But mind us “no” ko simple nahi rehne deta."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1050
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Woh usse expand karta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1051
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Dheere dheere woh rejection ban jaata hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1052
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am not enough”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1053
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am not chosen”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1054
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am not valuable”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1055
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“Something is fundamentally wrong with me”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1056
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jo cheez ek external moment thi…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1057
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "woh internal identity ban jaati hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1058
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur identity sabse dangerous hoti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1059
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Kyuki pain temporary hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1060
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But identity persistent hoti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1061
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur yahan ek invisible transformation hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1062
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek interpretation, agar repeat ho jaaye…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1063
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh woh perception ban jaata hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1064
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur perception, reality ko reshape karne lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1065
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Agar ek baar dimaag ne decide kar liya:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1066
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am not enough”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1067
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh duniya neutral nahi rehti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1068
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Duniya already interpreted hoti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1069
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Har silence rejection lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1070
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Har delay disrespect."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1071
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Har change abandonment."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1072
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Har unfamiliar tone threat."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1073
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Reality same rehti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1074
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But lens distorted ho jaata hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1075
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur distorted lens ko reality lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1076
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum log reality se directly nahi milte."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1077
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "We meet reality through filters."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1078
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur sabse dangerous baat yeh hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1079
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "filters humein pata bhi nahi hote."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1080
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum unhe “truth” samajh lete hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1081
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek aur pattern quietly chalta rehta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1082
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Selective memory."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1083
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum un moments ko zyada clarity dete hain jo humari existing story ko support karte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1084
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur un moments ko ignore kar dete hain jo us story ko break karte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1085
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Agar hum believe karte hain:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1086
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I always fail”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1087
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh dimaag 5 failures ko cinematic detail mein replay karta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1088
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur 20 small wins ko completely blur kar deta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1089
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because they are irrelevant."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1090
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But because they are dangerous to the narrative."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1091
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Kyuki agar story break ho gayi…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1092
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh identity unstable ho jaayegi."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1093
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur dheere dheere ek illusion ban jaata hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1094
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Life predictable lagne lagti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1095
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But life repeat nahi ho rahi hoti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1096
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum repeat kar rahe hote hain apni interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1097
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jab interpretation strong ho jaati hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1098
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh ek aur shift hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1099
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Question change ho jaata hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Pehle:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1101
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“What happened?”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1102
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Phir:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1103
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“Why did this happen?”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1104
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur phir finally:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1105
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“Why does this always happen to me?”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1106
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Yeh curiosity nahi hoti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1107
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Yeh reinforcement hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1108
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Existing belief system ko stable banane ka mechanism."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1109
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because “always” is not reality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1110
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is emotional pattern turned into belief."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1111
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur shayad sabse uncomfortable realization yeh hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1112
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You are not living your past."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1113
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "You are living your explanation of your past."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1114
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur explanation ka problem yeh hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1115
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "it feels more solid than truth."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1116
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Reality fluid hoti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1117
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Situations evolve karti hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1118
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "People change karte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1119
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Circumstances shift hoti hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1120
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But story stable lagti hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1121
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur human mind stability ko safety samajhta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1122
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Chahe woh false hi kyun na ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1123
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Stories comfort deti hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1124
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Kyuki stories chaos ko structure bana deti hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1125
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even if that structure is imaginary."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1126
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even if it is incomplete."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1127
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Even if it is biased."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1128
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A painful truth unstable lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1129
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But a meaningful lie stable lagta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1130
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur insaan aksar truth nahi choose karta."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1131
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Insaan stability choose karta hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1132
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Isliye closure addictive hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1133
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum sirf answers nahi dhoondh rahe hote."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1134
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum dhoondh rahe hote hain ek final explanation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1135
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Ek aisi story jo sab kuch end kar de."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1136
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Jo confusion ko permanently seal kar de."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1137
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But life rarely behaves like that."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1138
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So hum us gap ko khud fill kar dete hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1139
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jab story stable ho jaati hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1140
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh hum apni identity us story se fuse kar dete hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1141
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am unlucky.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1142
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am always rejected.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1143
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am not meant for this.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1144
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“I am stuck.”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1145
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur phir ek silent shift hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1146
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum experience karna band kar dete hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1147
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum interpret karna start kar dete hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1148
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But stories are not real structures."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1149
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "They are mental constructs."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1150
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And anything constructed…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1151
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "can collapse."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1152
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But collapse tabhi hota hai jab contradiction allow kiya jaaye."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1153
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Otherwise hum opposite karte hain."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1154
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Hum reality ko bend karte hain…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1155
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "to protect the story."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1156
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur yahin se ek loop form hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1157
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not a life loop."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1158
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But an interpretation loop."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1159
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Same events."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1160
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Different faces."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1161
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Same feeling."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1162
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Different situations."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1163
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But same internal conclusion."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1164
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur ek point pe ek deeper question arise hota hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1165
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1166
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“What happened?”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1167
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1168
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "“Why does everything feel the same again and again?”"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1169
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur answer uncomfortable hota hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1170
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because reality same nahi hoti."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1171
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lens same hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1172
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur shayad sabse disturbing realization yeh hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1173
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum apni life nahi jee rahe."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1174
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Tum apni life ki story jee rahe ho."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1175
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur jab yeh samajh aata hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1176
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh pehli baar ek gap open hota hai."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1177
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Between event and interpretation."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1178
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Between experience and meaning."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1179
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Between reality and story."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1180
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And that gap…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1181
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "is not confusion."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1182
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That gap is awareness starting for the first time."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1183
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Aur shayad yahin se Chapter 2 actually end nahi hota…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1184
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "yahin se ek naya question start hota hai:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1185
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Agar story truth nahi hai…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1186
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "toh phir main kya hoon?"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 1187
    }
